                <div>
                    <span class="text-ack-purple text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Welcome</span>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ack-purple-dark mt-2">
                        A Church of the Anglican Church of Kenya
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                        St. Phillips Roadblock serves the Roadblock and Kahoya communities under St.Marys Parish in the  Diocese of Eldoret.
                        We are a
                        <strong>caring, listening church</strong> — offering Anglican worship, sacraments and
                        estate
                        fellowships that bring the Gospel to every neighbourhood.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                        Whether you are new to faith or returning to church, you are welcome at our services. Come as
                        you are; leave encouraged in Christ.

                    </p>
                    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
